# Capture and observation notes

The session used local stopwatch sheets and first-selection cards. P7's guide stopwatch entry was lost during export; no other timing exists in this pack. Its guide first-selection card is retained and marked correct. Its later assistance flag is also retained. Do not reconstruct seconds from task order or another volunteer's record.

P3's reference first selection was wrong; P5's guide first selection was wrong. Observers later coached those tasks. The correct column describes the first selection and must not be rewritten to reflect eventual completion after help.

All records were collected in the same staffed exercise. Every volunteer tried both formats and repeated a lookup task. This supports a matched local description while leaving practice, staff assistance and ordinary-work transfer uncertain. No later unattended shift, expanded study or live rollout has occurred.

The draft summary was prepared before the missing-timing and first-selection notes were reconciled. It is historical input for correction, not a verified result.

'use strict';
const fs=require('node:fs'),path=require('node:path'),assert=require('node:assert/strict');
const root=path.resolve(__dirname,'..');
function read(relative,header){const lines=fs.readFileSync(path.join(root,relative),'utf8').trim().split(/\r?\n/);assert.equal(lines.shift(),header.join(','));return lines.map(line=>{const cells=line.split(',');assert.equal(cells.length,header.length);return Object.fromEntries(header.map((key,i)=>[key,cells[i]]));});}
const pairs=read('evidence/pairs.csv',['pair_id','volunteer_id','task','first_format']);
const reference=read('evidence/reference.csv',['pair_id','seconds','correct','assisted']);
const guide=read('evidence/guide.csv',['pair_id','seconds','correct','assisted']);
const ids=pairs.map(row=>row.pair_id).sort();assert.equal(new Set(ids).size,ids.length);
for(const rows of [reference,guide]){assert.deepEqual(rows.map(row=>row.pair_id).sort(),ids);for(const row of rows){assert(['true','false'].includes(row.correct));assert(['true','false'].includes(row.assisted));assert(row.seconds===''||Number(row.seconds)>0);}}
process.stdout.write(JSON.stringify({pairs:pairs.length,volunteers:new Set(pairs.map(row=>row.volunteer_id)).size,reference_rows:reference.length,guide_rows:guide.length,missing_guide_times:guide.filter(row=>row.seconds==='').map(row=>row.pair_id)},null,2)+'\n');

